sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as API
  participant R as Rule Parser
  participant L as LLM (tuỳ chọn)
  participant V as ANN + Rerank
  U->>A: query
  A->>R: parse (3 ms)
  par
    A->>V: retrieve (403 ms)
  and
    A->>L: parse đầy đủ (150-300 ms)
  end
  L-->>A: intent + sub_queries + hop_chain
  alt khớp rule-parse
    A-->>U: kết quả (~410 ms)
  else khác
    A->>V: re-rank lại (+200 ms)
    A-->>U: kết quả (~610 ms)
  end
